<title>UK: Greene King yr pretax up before charge.</title>
<headline>Greene King yr pretax up before charge.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to May 3</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		46.9		   vs 40.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 11.6		   vs N/A</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 16.35		  vs 14.57</p>
<p> Pretax		     36.7		   vs 24.7</p>
<p> Turnover		   253.6		  vs 165.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Above current year pretax profits exclude exceptional charges of about 15.4 million stg for restructuring and other items. Including exceptionals, pretax profit was 21.3 million stg.</p>
<p>Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 34.8 and 37.3 million stg.</p>
<p>Full name of brewing company - Greene King Plc. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
